  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Atlantic Cocoa Processing and Export Company (ACPEC) will use this grant to increase the volume of high-quality cocoa available for export to international markets, expand its network of certified farmers, increase the capacity of its organization and cocoa farming partners, and acquire additional transportation and production.</narrative>
